{"id":"2bc9d494c7bff68e","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md","title":"Fixed Linear Structures and Linear Isomorphisms","display":"df-linear-structure-data — Fixed Linear Structures and Linear Isomorphisms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-linear-structure-data","aliases":["58-df-linear-structure-data"],"display":"df-linear-structure-data — Fixed Linear Structures and Linear Isomorphisms","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-linear-structure-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-linear-structure-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-linear-structure-data — Fixed Linear Structures and Linear Isomorphisms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\">\\(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr A\">\\(\\mathscr A\\)</span> 及函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr L:\\mathscr A\\to V\">\\(\\mathscr L:\\mathscr A\\to V\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\mathscr A\\;\\mathrm{LinearStructureData}_S(\\mathscr L(A),A,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\(\\forall A\\in\\mathscr A\\;\\mathrm{LinearStructureData}_S(\\mathscr L(A),A,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span>。该条件使用下式定义的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathscr A\">\\(A\\in\\mathscr A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_A=\\operatorname{pr}_0(\\mathscr L(A))\">\\(+_A=\\operatorname{pr}_0(\\mathscr L(A))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot_A=\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\mathscr L(A))\">\\(\\odot_A=\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\mathscr L(A))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_0\\langle a,b\\rangle=a\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_0\\langle a,b\\rangle=a\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_1\\langle a,b\\rangle=b\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_1\\langle a,b\\rangle=b\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinIso}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{LinIso}_k\\)</span> 是相对于上述固定域结构及固定向量空间结构族的三元谓词；调用者沿用同一组结构参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in W^A\">\\(f\\in W^A\\)</span> 使用集合论函数图编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>二元运算以有序对为自变量：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_A(x,y)=+_A(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(+_A(x,y)=+_A(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot_A(a,x)=\\odot_A(\\langle a,x\\rangle)\">\\(\\odot_A(a,x)=\\odot_A(\\langle a,x\\rangle)\\)</span>；对其他已声明的二元运算使用同一缩写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinearStructureData}_S(D,A,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n(D=\\langle+_A,\\odot_A\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinearStructureData}_S(D,A,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n(D=\\langle+_A,\\odot_A\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinIso}_k(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA,B\\in\\mathscr A\\land f\\in B^A\\land\\operatorname{ran}f=B\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\n\\bigl(f(+_A(x,y))=+_B(f(x),f(y))\n\\land f(\\odot_A(a,x))=\\odot_B(a,f(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinIso}_k(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA,B\\in\\mathscr A\\land f\\in B^A\\land\\operatorname{ran}f=B\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\n\\bigl(f(+_A(x,y))=+_B(f(x),f(y))\n\\land f(\\odot_A(a,x))=\\odot_B(a,f(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>三元线性同构接口没有增加参数，但其原先隐含的域结构和向量空间运算现在是明确固定的环境参数。</li>\n<li>不能在每次线性同构测试内任意重选源、目标的运算，否则任意集合双射都能通过测试，向量丛的转移线性条件会被抹去。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{VectorSpace}$ 取 [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr L:\\mathscr A\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A\\in\\mathscr A\\;\\mathrm{LinearStructureData}_S(\\mathscr L(A),A,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathscr A","display":false},{"tex":"+_A=\\operatorname{pr}_0(\\mathscr L(A))","display":false},{"tex":"\\odot_A=\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\mathscr L(A))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_0\\langle a,b\\rangle=a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_1\\langle a,b\\rangle=b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinIso}_k","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in W^A","display":false},{"tex":"+_A(x,y)=+_A(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\odot_A(a,x)=\\odot_A(\\langle a,x\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinearStructureData}_S(D,A,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n(D=\\langle+_A,\\odot_A\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinIso}_k(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nA,B\\in\\mathscr A\\land f\\in B^A\\land\\operatorname{ran}f=B\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\to x=y)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\n\\bigl(f(+_A(x,y))=+_B(f(x),f(y))\n\\land f(\\odot_A(a,x))=\\odot_B(a,f(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2293,"backlinks":[{"id":"3f045a36dba6b5ef","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{LinIso}$ 取 [[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"eaa26a086cb6c5af","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p,E,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,k\\in V$，$r\\in\\omega$。固定域结构 $(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)$ 及 [[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]] 的 $\\mathscr A,\\mathscr L$。"},{"id":"97bfaddac2f220a7","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{LinIso}$ 取 [[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-788","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md|58-df-linear-structure-data]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2","1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751"]}